@startuml
actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Nexo" as System
Admin -> System: Register organization and admin account (org name, admin email, admin name)
System -> System: Validate details and check email uniqueness
alt Valid and email available
    System --> Admin: Organization and admin account created; signed in
else Invalid details or email already in use
    System --> Admin: Registration rejected (validation or conflict error)
end
@enduml
